
# Python Dice Roller

A simple command-line dice rolling application written in Python.

## Features
- Roll multiple dice at once
- Customize the number of sides
- Calculate the total result
- Display the time of each roll
- Input validation

## Requirements
- Python 3.8+

## Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/python-dice-roller.git
```

Run the application:

```bash
python dice_roller.py
```

